<title>POLAND: Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven stocks fell, three rose and eight were flat in 12.7-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The remaining four stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell one percent to 144 zlotys in a 10-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
